{"version":1,"content":"<p>莫斯科大學中國籍留學生陳宇昕近日在課堂上身披象徵日本軍國主義的旭日旗引發批評。</p><p>官媒《環球時報》昨（19日）報道稱，該生已被開除、遣返，校方將盡快公布處理結果。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:39:07.911271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:09:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:43.177589+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:37:49.120930+00:00","content_hash":"9437c7e9f775ad5ff21e264f6841921062acbf2eb8590a5ee197e06561705e30","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}